00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:05.605 line:0%
- WE MET B-BOY JOSEPH
IN ATLANTA, G.A.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.440
- HI, JOSEPH.

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:09.042
- [British accent]
ALL RIGHT. YEAH.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.309
START THE MUSIC.

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:13.312
[hip-hop music]

00:00:13.345 --> 00:00:19.218
♪ ♪

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:21.821
- HAS HE STARTED YET?

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.057
- I THINK--
I'M PRETTY SURE THIS IS IT.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:31.498
♪ ♪

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:37.370
THANK YOU.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:39.739
- YEAH, THANK YOU.
- I AIN'T DONE YET, THOUGH.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.574
- THANK YOU, JOSEPH.

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:43.209
IT'S--IT'S
DEFINITELY A NO FOR ME.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.111
- IT'S A NO. I'M SORRY.

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:46.712
- NO.

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:48.448
- ALL RIGHT.
THANK YOU, JOSEPH.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.586
- GUYS, YOU--YOU KNOW,

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:54.754
I AIN'T GOT NO FORMAL TRAININ'
OR NOTHIN' LIKE THAT.

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:56.789
I LIVE ON THE STREETS.

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:58.758
- THAT WAS VERY APPARENT,
AS IT TURNS OUT, JOSEPH.

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.094
THANK YOU FOR COMING.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.629
- Y-YOU KNOW THAT MY MAMA'S
ON DRUGS, AND MY DADDY IN JAIL.

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:06.632
- IT'S NOT--
NOT REALLY RELEVANT.

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:07.867
- BORN IN A COFFEE CAN
UNDER A BRIDGE.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.836
- THAT'S TERRIBLE, JOSEPH.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.271
THAT'S--THAT'S AWFUL,
BUT IT'S NOT GOING TO--

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:14.574
- MY SISTER SHOT MY BROTHER
WHILE MY COUSIN BEAT MY UNCLE.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.843
- NOW IT'S A LIE.
- IT'S A LITTLE BIT MUCH.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.311
JOSEPH, THANK YOU
VERY MUCH, BUT--

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.246
- PUT MYSELF THROUGH SCHOOL

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.482
BY RENTING MY BODY OUT
AS A HEROIN SUITCASE.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.617
- OH, I SEE WHAT'S GOING ON.
- WOW.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.353
- JOSEPH, PLEASE, WE--WE DO HAVE
OTHER DANCERS HERE TODAY,

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:29.188
WHO ARE WAITING THEIR TURN
VERY POLITELY.

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:30.890
NO, JOSEPH,
LET HER COME ONSTAGE.

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.259
- OH! OH!
- LET HER COME--NO, JOSEPH.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:35.361
- IF I WIN THIS COMPETITION, I
COULD PUT A ROOF OVER MY HOUSE.

00:01:35.394 --> 00:01:36.395
'CAUSE I GOT A HOUSE AIN'T
GOT NO ROOF. FOR REAL, THOUGH.

00:01:36.428 --> 00:01:38.197
- JOSEPH...

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.365
- JUST ONE LITTLE THING,
THOUGH.

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:41.400
- DON'T DO IT, JOSEPH.

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:43.202
- IT WAS A LOUD BRIDGE.
- DON'T FINISH THAT SEN--

00:01:43.235 --> 00:01:44.804
- I GOT HEARING DAMAGE
IN THIS EAR.

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:45.838
- JOSEPH!
- AND ALSO IN THIS EAR.

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:47.740
- JOSEPH!

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:49.542
- THE BRIDGE HAD--
HAD TRUCKS GO OVER IT.

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:51.210
- JOSEPH.
- 'CAUSE THE BRIDGE--

00:01:51.243 --> 00:01:52.245
- KEEP IT.
- 15-TON--

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.213
- HOLD IT.

00:01:54.246 --> 00:01:55.314
PUT IT IN YOUR MOUTH.
AND GET OFF MY STAGE.

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:56.916
- RA--RATED SIX.

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:58.684
- JOE...
- THAT'S A BIG TRUCK.

00:01:58.717 --> 00:01:59.785
- SEPH.
OKAY, JOSEPH, PLEASE.

00:01:59.818 --> 00:02:01.554
AND WHO IS THIS?

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:03.689
- OH, WHO IS THIS
RIGHT HERE?

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:05.758
THIS IS MY 12-YEAR-OLD DAUGHTER,
WHO I RAISED ALL BY MYSELF

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:06.926
WITHOUT THE HELP OF ANYBODY ELSE
IN THE ENTIRE WORLD.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:08.694
SHE IS MY INSPIRATION.

00:02:08.727 --> 00:02:10.496
- JOSEPH,
IT DOESN'T MATTER.

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:12.465
THERE'S NOTHING
YOU CAN DO OR SAY

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:14.600
THAT'S GOING TO MAKE US
CHANGE OUR MINDS TODAY.

00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:15.635
- THAT RIGHT THERE, THAT RIGHT
THERE, THAT'S HER DAUGHTER.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:19.839
SHE BLIND.

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:22.675
SO I RAISED THEM BOTH BY MYSELF
WITHOUT NOBODY ELSE'S HELP.

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.810
- COME GET
YOUR TICKET TO VEGAS.

00:02:24.843 --> 00:02:27.547
- WHOO-HOO-HOO-HOO!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.682
- VEGAS!
- CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:31.718
I'M GETTING GOOSIES OVER HERE.
I'M GETTING GOOSIES. I-I AM.

